{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-38","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与直径与立方","englishTitle":"If the sides of the opposite planes of a cube be bisected, and planes be carried through the points of section, the common section of the planes and the diameter of the cube bisect one another.","book":11,"number":38,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.38","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.38/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":38,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-38@raw-ec18e871aa0055bc","contentId":"euclid-11-38","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec18e871aa0055bc9c50ae1f018fd44ff8fa1b364a40830249b70080bf9bd2bb","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-38.statement","euclid-11-38.construction.1","euclid-11-38.proof.1","euclid-11-38.construction.2","euclid-11-38.proof.2","euclid-11-38.proof.3","euclid-11-38.proof.4","euclid-11-38.proof.5","euclid-11-38.proof.6","euclid-11-38.proof.7","euclid-11-38.proof.8","euclid-11-38.proof.9","euclid-11-38.proof.10","euclid-11-38.conclusion","euclid-11-38.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-38.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-38","revisionId":"euclid-11-38@raw-ec18e871aa0055bc","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a984b34390f062d35428ecb74c330dc798d1708b598277d86a65d9514abaa7ae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If the sides of the opposite planes of a cube be bisected, and planes be carried through the points of section, the common section of the planes and the diameter of the cube bisect one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果对面的平面立方体的两侧被两截,平面则通过部分的点,平面的共部分和立方体的直径相互分割。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-38.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-38","revisionId":"euclid-11-38@raw-ec18e871aa0055bc","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"41c6422f489e61e30a289343d4847506ae3452850c776522e4f1bd894386ed99","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the sides of the opposite planes CF, AH of the cube AF be bisected at the points K, L, M, N, O, Q, P, R, and through the points of section let the planes KN, OR be carried; let US be the common section of the planes, and DG the diameter of the cube AF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将AF立方体的平面 CF和AH两侧分成两部分,分别放在K、L、M、N、O、Q、P、R点,并穿过部分各点,将平面 KN、OR作为平面的共同部分,US作为US作为AF立方体的直径。（相关点与线段：DG）"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-38.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-38","revisionId":"euclid-11-38@raw-ec18e871aa0055bc","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"42c94755f6513b3fdf6dc13d285bbaac7e2e524643fd7a2445ac5a8d9d41305e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that UT is equal to TS, and DT to TG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说UT等于TS,DT至TG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-38.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-38","revisionId":"euclid-11-38@raw-ec18e871aa0055bc","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ba9df07c39c30f4336b715c88e17c874e10813f54b0991ea91a8eeaf16f690f1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let DU, UE, BS, SG be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DU,UE,BS,SG连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-38.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-38","revisionId":"euclid-11-38@raw-ec18e871aa0055bc","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"716f591daca6630d7aa368d81a3a563c1c79776bfa606e249fd834862279b5b1","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since DO is parallel to PE, the alternate angles DOU, UPE are equal to one another. [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"礛由于DO与PE平行,内错角,DOU,UPE是等同的。 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-38.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-38","revisionId":"euclid-11-38@raw-ec18e871aa0055bc","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"52b99bf86b8574d8c735154f161f8296806f9b192abf8726ffe0d552d8edc278","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since DO is equal to PE, and OU to UP, and they contain equal angles, therefore the base DU is equal to the base UE, the triangle DOU is equal to the triangle PUE, and the remaining angles are equal to the remaining angles; [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)] therefore the angle OUD is equal to the angle PUE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于DO等于PE,OU至UP, 并且它们包含相等角度, 因此底边 DU等于底边 UE, 三角形DOU等于三角形PUE, 其余角度等于其余角度; 因此, 角度OUD等于角度PUE。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-38.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-38","revisionId":"euclid-11-38@raw-ec18e871aa0055bc","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a674e82d731b12cf470b5ea9df7c96816ab450b5f67a9ff3a8ce99deb7394053","citations":["euclid-1-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For this reason DUE is a straight line. [[I. 14](/principles/euclid-1-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DUE是一条直线。 [[I. 14](/principles/euclid-1-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-38.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-38","revisionId":"euclid-11-38@raw-ec18e871aa0055bc","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6ef5018d8c066b10c49fda5d470f8a4ed1cf288e5ebf8949b2ad4ce07656b523","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason, BSG is also a straight line, and BS is equal to SG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,BSG也是一条直线,BS等于SG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-38.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-38","revisionId":"euclid-11-38@raw-ec18e871aa0055bc","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f74e6e0c1eaef3ca3a4126376e574468f837fb5bf7ffc5a9b1889053dbb8dae","citations":["euclid-11-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since CA is equal and parallel to DB, while CA is also equal and parallel to EG, therefore DB is also equal and parallel to EG. [[XI. 9](/principles/euclid-11-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,CA是相等的,平行的DB,而CA是相等的,平行的EG,因此DB也是相等的,平行的EG。 [[XI. 9](/principles/euclid-11-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-38.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-38","revisionId":"euclid-11-38@raw-ec18e871aa0055bc","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d9df83a86665aa1496bac2ce466f5a1760c782a7fcf5693e20726f0c3eafa58","citations":["euclid-1-33"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the straight lines DE, BG join their extremities; therefore DE is parallel to BG. [[I. 33](/principles/euclid-1-33)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线DE,BG连接它们的极限, 因此DE是平行的BG。 [[I. 33](/principles/euclid-1-33)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-38.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-11-38","revisionId":"euclid-11-38@raw-ec18e871aa0055bc","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"99468dc606fc5cf4da927aa9584ac2d05decac19d7621063fc882e22e75516d7","citations":["euclid-1-29","euclid-1-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle EDT is equal to the angle BGT, for they are alternate; [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] and the angle DTU is equal to the angle GTS. [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EDT角等于BGT角,因为它们是交替的;DTU角等于GTS角。 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-38.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-11-38","revisionId":"euclid-11-38@raw-ec18e871aa0055bc","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"458ed3aca51632e5f4cb1e2dbfec5a08576722ab06cf885ad72228fa9902d434","citations":["euclid-1-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DTU, GTS are two triangles which have two angles equal to two angles, and one side equal to one side, namely that subtending one of the equal angles, that is, DU equal to GS, for they are the halves of DE, BG; therefore they will also have the remaining sides equal to the remaining sides. [[I. 26](/principles/euclid-1-26)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DTU,GTS是两个三角形,两个角等于两个角度,一方等于一面,即一个相等角度,即DU等于GS,因为它们是DE,BG的半边;因此,它们也拥有其余方等于其余方。 [[I. 26](/principles/euclid-1-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-38.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-11-38","revisionId":"euclid-11-38@raw-ec18e871aa0055bc","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7e15e6ac616948c63c0da3e1fc59865bc960576c5e4517c4d6f1003e4a6411f7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DT is equal to TG, and UT to TS."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DT等于TG,UT至TS。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-38.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-38","revisionId":"euclid-11-38@raw-ec18e871aa0055bc","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-38.source","contentId":"euclid-11-38","revisionId":"euclid-11-38@raw-ec18e871aa0055bc","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75232a2a58b2d2710f035d04a2b38d432d813412e52f5bbaae6051a2b8fa1e83","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.38/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.38\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-38:euclid-1-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-38","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-38.proof.2","euclid